# Paths scripts/verify-references.sh must not report as STALE in this repo.
# One glob per line. A token's own line can opt out instead with
# <!-- verify-references: ignore -->, but that skips every path on the line.

# Setup stamp written into target repos by scripts/stamp-version.sh; the
# toolkit repo itself is never set up, so it has none.
.claude/mtk-version.json

# Handoff notes: the writer creates docs/handoffs/ with a self-ignoring
# .gitignore at run time, so a fresh clone has no such directory.
docs/handoffs/*.md
